OL,3,GNEWSAFatal crash victim 'missed
OL,4,Adeeply', says family
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was killed in a car crash in
OL,7,FBradford "made the world brighter just
OL,8,Fby being in it", members of his family
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FEugen Matta, 45, died after he was hit
OL,12,Fby a black Cupra Leon being driven on
OL,13,FKillinghall Road towards Bradford Moor
OL,14,FPark at about 20:50 BST on Thursday,
OL,15,Faccording to West Yorkshire Police.
OL,17,FTwo women, aged 19 and 47, were
OL,18,Farrested on suspicion of dangerous
OL,19,Fdriving and had since been released on
OL,20,Fbail pending further inquiries, a
OL,21,Fspokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
